{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851010/extras/45fd58753460fc4b46488a15e50f6696.avif?t=1766940449\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, where <strong><i>is</i></strong> the flock anyway? Lost on a mountain, that\u2019s where! And it\u2019s a dangerous one at that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Where The Flock!?</strong> \u2013 you\u2019ll help an old Farmer rescue his lost herd of sheep from a treacherous mountain. Using a selection of tools \u2013 from parachutes to dynamite and more \u2013 you\u2019ll guide the herd of tiny sheep back to safety. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning dozens of levels across 3 chapters, you\u2019ll devise unique strategies to solve each challenge in order to progress. Every level has more than one way to be solved, meaning success comes down to your own flavour of creativity with the tools at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic A-to-B puzzle platformers of the 90\u2019s, <strong>Where The Flock!?</strong> is a hand-crafted 2D pixel art adventure loaded to the brim with fun and nostalgia. See <strong>you</strong> on the mountain!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851010?t=1766940449","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851010?t=1766940449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851010/815ea45c888ddeca907f016b38da4f0acd75f3ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766940449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851010/815ea45c888ddeca907f016b38da4f0acd75f3ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766940449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid"